# Line endings.
#
# The repository stores LF; a Windows checkout gets CRLF, which matches the
# existing `core.autocrlf=true` configuration. Declaring it explicitly stops a
# stray LF-only write from showing up as a whole-file diff, and stops a tool
# that writes LF from fighting the checkout.
* text=auto
*.rs text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
# CI / 打包脚本按行解析这两个文件，行尾必须是 LF：Windows 检出若写成 CRLF，
# `awk '$2 == asset'` 会拿到带 \r 的字段而永远匹配不上。
# （Cargo.toml 等交给 cargo 解析的 toml 不在此列，无需额外约定。）
rust-toolchain.toml text eol=lf
scripts/ffmpeg-checksums.txt text eol=lf

# pack-release.ps1 必须带 UTF-8 BOM。Windows PowerShell 5.1（本地开发最常用的那个，
# AGENTS.md 里的 `./scripts/pack-release.ps1` 就是它）在没有 BOM 时按系统 ANSI 代码页
# 读文件：中文注释只是变乱码，但中文**字符串**会被误解码，偶尔还会凭空多出一个引号
# 让整个脚本解析失败。release.yml 用的是 pwsh（默认 UTF-8），所以这个坑只在本地显形。
# 加 BOM 对两个版本都安全，不要去掉。
scripts/pack-release.ps1 text eol=crlf

# macOS 磁盘映像里的说明文件：原样交给用户，固定 LF。
installer/macos/* text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touched by the end-of-line machinery.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.safetensors binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
